<title>FINLAND: FINNISH JUNE TRADE DATA DUE TODAY AT 1200 -NCB.</title>
<headline>FINNISH JUNE TRADE DATA DUE TODAY AT 1200 -NCB.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish June foreign trade data will be released today at 1200/0900 GMT, the National Customs Board (NCB) said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>In May, Finland's trade surplus was 4.59 billion markka, according to NCB data.</p>
<p>The Bank of Finland has estimated the June trade balance at 7.8 billion markka with exports at 17.6 billion markka and imports at 9.8 billion markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
